cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ScalingCollapse.jl in your research, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file, and state the version you used.
type: software
title: ScalingCollapse.jl
abstract: >-
  ScalingCollapse.jl is a Julia package for automatic finite-size scaling.
  Given an observable measured for several system sizes, it finds the
  critical point and the critical exponents for which the curves of all sizes
  collapse onto a single master curve, and estimates their errors. It offers
  preset and custom scaling forms, several quality measures of the collapse
  (spline, linear and Houdayer), a parameter scan followed by Nelder-Mead
  fits, and profile, conditional and bootstrap error analyses.
authors:
